# Citation File Format —— GitHub 会据此显示「Cite this repository」。
# 它**不随 npm 包发布**（package.json 的 files 里没有它）：服务的是仓库访客，不是安装者。
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this library in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "sleepmetrics"
abstract: >-
  Standard sleep metrics in pure JavaScript: sleep regularity index (SRI) and
  circadian phase (MSFsc / social jetlag), plus a data-health audit and a
  rule-layer suggestion engine. Zero dependencies, no build step, no network,
  and the library core touches neither the filesystem nor the clock.
type: software
authors:
